<p><strong>Terminology:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Adjacent node/neighbor: two nodes are adjacent if there=E2=80=99s an ed=
ge connecting them.</li>
<li>Degree: the number of edges connected to a node.</li>
<li>Path: a sequence of nodes connected by edges.</li>
</ul>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
