ing the connection strength or cost between nodes.  The third graph, labele=
d 'cyclic:', displays a cyclic undirected graph with nodes 0 through 4.  Th=
is graph contains a cycle, highlighted by thicker peach-colored edges, betw=
een nodes 0, 2, and 3; the word 'cycle' is written in orange within this cy=
