<h2 id=3D"real-world-example">Real-world Example</h2>
<p><strong>Social networks:</strong> Users of social media sites like Linke=
dIn are typically represented as nodes, and connections or friendships betw=
een users are represented as edges. The graph structure allows platforms to=
 analyze relationships, suggest new connections, and identify groups or com=
munities within their networks.</p>
